The passages Mast ships with are not covered by the licence above; each is
under its own terms, and config/passages.json carries them per passage:

  config/paragraphs.txt   written for Mast, MIT with the rest.

  Books                   excerpts from public domain texts on Project
                          Gutenberg, listed in config/books.yml. Public domain
                          in the United States; check your own country.

  The Conversation        excerpts from articles listed in config/articles.yml,
                          shared under CC BY-ND 4.0 with their authors, title
                          and link, unaltered but for typography:
                          https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/
